/// Returns `(eigenvalues, eigenvectors_columns)` where the i-th
/// eigenvector is `eigvecs.column(i)`. Uses cyclic Jacobi rotations
/// on real / complex off-diagonal pairs; `O(n³)` per sweep, converges
